From 2b330275edad46da9d73d208f2f79054b9598cfb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Dr. Hutson" <dev@hutsonlabs.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 09:07:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ironrdp): sspi 0.23 and picky 7.0.0-rc.26

picky rc.25 pins exact RustCrypto prereleases (curve25519-dalek =5.0.0-rc.1, p256 =0.14.0-rc.14,
ecdsa =0.17.0-rc.22) that no russh release can share; rc.26 (via sspi 0.22+) takes the final
releases. sspi 0.23's TsRequest::buffer_len returns a Result, mapped like the encode error next
to it in the connector, acceptor and vmconnect.

ironrdp-testsuite-core, -connector, -acceptor: 1719 passed. Drift's drift-rdp and drift-testkit
(NLA against the FakeServer): 131 passed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
